{
  "work_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate",
  "source_path": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate.json",
  "source_language": "cop",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-30": {
      "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-30",
      "script": "__main__"
    },
    "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27": {
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-27",
      "script": "__main__"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.000.0000",
      "source_sha256": "59e42d6e9fe7015f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "that a revolt had taken place."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.000.0001",
      "source_sha256": "65a70e463c67f631",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They said to him again, “We know that this man is righteous.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.000.0002",
      "source_sha256": "c71da90ddc451f13",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They, for their part, remained untroubled."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.000.0003",
      "source_sha256": "a6e4b7c1a43af856",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Then Pilate called together the whole crowd of Jews."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.000.0004",
      "source_sha256": "fd3974f99dc83601",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He said to them, “You have a law that I should release someone for you at each festival."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.000.0005",
      "source_sha256": "140dd4c5ea77af0d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For you have a prisoner who is a murderer, whose name is Barabbas,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.000.0006",
      "source_sha256": "50d1917986e36c62",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and Jesus, who stands before you, against whom I have found no grounds for an accusation. Which of these two do you want me to release for you?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.000.0007",
      "source_sha256": "84dc8fd5f9fda432",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They shouted, “Release Barabbas for us!”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.000.0008",
      "source_sha256": "153e2caed52c215f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He said to them again, “What, then, should I do with Jesus, who is called the Christ?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.000.0009",
      "source_sha256": "8ae42c07463b202a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They said to him, “Crucify him!” Others among the Jews were saying, “If you release this man, you are no friend of the emperor, because he said, ‘I am a son of God,’"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.000.0010",
      "source_sha256": "4cce15c5a45c0b7f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and also, ‘I am a king.’"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.000.0011",
      "source_sha256": "32e6a2de809409ce",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Perhaps you want this man to rule over us rather than the emperor Caesar!” Pilate became angry."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.000.0012",
      "source_sha256": "dee630cdde8cef8f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He said to the Jews, “Your nation is truly always rebelling,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.000.0013",
      "source_sha256": "33f3345cc29ccd8e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and you oppose those who do you good.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.000.0014",
      "source_sha256": "07c74a16b4819b15",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The Jews said, “What good things?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.000.0015",
      "source_sha256": "f55b3af2ef33c4a0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He said to them, “Your God brought you out of harsh slavery in the land of Egypt."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.000.0016",
      "source_sha256": "8351357dc6b5c292",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He led you through the sea as though it were dry ground."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.000.0017",
      "source_sha256": "77ec16dd9b19dbdc",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He fed you with manna in the wilderness."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.000.0018",
      "source_sha256": "16f73ec6a1ca561b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He brought you quails."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.000.0019",
      "source_sha256": "1176a08e1abb8342",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He gave you water to drink from a rock."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.000.0020",
      "source_sha256": "1d41795e740f093f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He gave you a law."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.000.0021",
      "source_sha256": "e521c6e1965a2216",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Yet despite all these things, you provoked your God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.000.0022",
      "source_sha256": "b25614caa574ed15",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "You made a calf in the wilderness"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.000.0023",
      "source_sha256": "e92934cda69ad133",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and worshiped it. He sought to kill you, until Moses pleaded on your behalf so that you would not die."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.000.0024",
      "source_sha256": "0cad642a5f12c924",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Now, in turn, you say to me, ‘You hate the emperor Caesar.’”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.000.0025",
      "source_sha256": "0fecd1e9389859ca",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Pilate immediately rose from the judgment seat."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.000.0026",
      "source_sha256": "3841096a0d74ec46",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He sought to withdraw."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.000.0027",
      "source_sha256": "f10e3d1dccd362a6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They cried out."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.001.0000",
      "source_sha256": "56df5e928d705850",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-30",
      "group_size": 1,
      "text": "[?] ...ei... [?] and the soldiers divided his garments among themselves."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.001.0001",
      "source_sha256": "0133c5feba0a966b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And all the people stood watching him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.001.0002",
      "source_sha256": "1062383331a7d104",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And the chief priests sneered at him,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.001.0003",
      "source_sha256": "1f78bc085cf4577f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "along with the rulers, saying, “He saved others."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.001.0004",
      "source_sha256": "9ae6d813310499ee",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Can he not save himself, if he is God's chosen Son?” And the soldiers mocked him,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.001.0005",
      "source_sha256": "35469df9300c437d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "having approached him with vinegar, saying, “If you are the Son of God, save yourself.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.001.0006",
      "source_sha256": "26cf74d83379593c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Pilate gave orders,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.001.0007",
      "source_sha256": "b08975198150202b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "after the sentence, to write the charge against him on a notice, written in Hebrew,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.001.0008",
      "source_sha256": "76606df2b5b19754",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Latin, and Greek, as the Jews had said."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.001.0009",
      "source_sha256": "e75332a9a05eb2ba",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Now one of the robbers who had been crucified with him, whose name was Gestas,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.001.0010",
      "source_sha256": "721acebb8585c52b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "said to him, “If you are the Son of God, save yourself and us too.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.001.0011",
      "source_sha256": "e2c08cb31a0d48f7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The other, whose name was Dismas, answered."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.001.0012",
      "source_sha256": "fae126c959f72374",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He rebuked him, saying, “Do you not fear God, since we are under the same sentence as he is?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.001.0013",
      "source_sha256": "376c5bc955319e33",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "For we are justly receiving what we deserve for what we have done. But this man has done nothing wrong."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.001.0014",
      "source_sha256": "3f6f7a5a904f6f4f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "And he deserves death."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.001.0015",
      "source_sha256": "71a60eef0b2bfa42",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "They brought him here."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.001.0016",
      "source_sha256": "069f5192a2160eac",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "Then Dismas turned again and said to Jesus, “My Lord, remember me when you come into your holy kingdom.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.001.0017",
      "source_sha256": "c45ea0a7cd35e3dd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "“And glorious.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.001.0018",
      "source_sha256": "89d632082c675548",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "Jesus said to him, “Truly I tell you, today you will be with me in my paradise.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.001.0019",
      "source_sha256": "b2c0621f58cc0f91",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "For it was the sixth hour."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.001.0020",
      "source_sha256": "f0b701a07e09fe2b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "Darkness came over the whole land until the ninth hour. The sun was darkened."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.001.0021",
      "source_sha256": "9d170b881af390e1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "And the curtain of the temple tore from top to bottom and split in two."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.001.0022",
      "source_sha256": "d14176b91567776a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "Jesus cried out in a loud voice, “My Father!”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.001.0023.s1",
      "source_sha256": "5f335b2cb13d4998",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "“Ani adakh ephkidrou, Adonai, aroa, Sabel, Louel, Eloi, elemas, abakdanei, Orioth, Mioth, Ouaath [?].”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.001.0023.s2",
      "source_sha256": "f9617ad3dfb1ad56",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "“Soun Perineth, Iothat [?].” The Savior’s prayer on the cross concerning Adam. At the moment when the Savior said these things,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.001.0024",
      "source_sha256": "0081cddda957b885",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "the air changed."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.001.0025",
      "source_sha256": "e2faa9ac6a8c9ac8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "The place grew dark."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.001.0026",
      "source_sha256": "385336377d062b6d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "The abyss split open."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/acts_pilate#CopScr.acts-pilate.001.0027",
      "source_sha256": "1e52f46e3bea0636",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-27",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "The firmament was shaken."
    }
  ]
}
